// What is Data Mining?

- Extraction of interesting patterns or knowledge from huge amounts of data 

Alternative names
    - Knowledge discovery (mining) in databases (KDD), knowledge extraction, data/pattern analysis, data archeology, data dredging, info harvesting, business intelligence, etc. 

